    "content": "<div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5a8b4722,#5a8b4711);border-left:4px solid #5a8b47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#5a8b47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">徒儿，今日为师传你 <b>《九霄风云谱》</b>，属于<b>必修1·第二章 大气</b>，磐山界之核心。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🌍 一、引道·地理精髓</h3><p>大气受热过程、热力环流、季风、气候类型分布。</p><div class=\"dlg-shimei\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4a3c822,#f4a3c811);border-left:4px solid #f4a3c8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#f4a3c8\">🎀 师妹：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">师姐，地理综合题好难！</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shijie\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c67ecb22,#c67ecb11);border-left:4px solid #c67ecb;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#c67ecb\">🌸 师姐：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">地理讲究\"地对人\"——先看<b>大气受热三过程：太阳短波→地面吸收→地面长波→大气增温</b>，再分析人类活动如何回应。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">📖 二、拆经·五大要点</h3><ul style=\"padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9\"><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 大气受热三过程：太阳短波→地面吸收→地面长波→大气增温</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 热力环流：冷高压/热低压</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 三圈环流：赤道低压、副高、副极地低压、极地高压</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 季风：海陆热力差异 + 气压带风带季节移动</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 气压带风带随太阳直射点南北移动</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🗺️ 三、图解·关键公式/数据</h3><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f8ee,#e6f0dd);border:1px dashed #5a8b47;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#3a5a2e\"><b>📜 气温递减率 0.6℃/100m</b></div><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f8ee,#e6f0dd);border:1px dashed #5a8b47;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#3a5a2e\"><b>📜 气压随海拔升高降低</b></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🔥 四、演道·典型案例</h3><p>夏季亚洲低压强烈发展，东亚夏季东南季风、南亚西南季风</p><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">💬 五、对话·师徒印证</h3><div class=\"dlg-shixiong\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4a7fc822,#4a7fc811);border-left:4px solid #4a7fc8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#4a7fc8\">⚔️ 大师兄：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">地理答题最重要的三条：<b>①区位分析要全面 ②因果链要完整 ③结合材料信息</b>。别死背模板！</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shimei\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4a3c822,#f4a3c811);border-left:4px solid #f4a3c8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#f4a3c8\">🎀 师妹：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">答案总是不够全面怎么办？</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shijie\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c67ecb22,#c67ecb11);border-left:4px solid #c67ecb;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#c67ecb\">🌸 师姐：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">用<b>自然（气候/地形/水文/土壤/植被）+ 社会经济（人/交/市/技/政）</b>的框架去扫描。</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5a8b4722,#5a8b4711);border-left:4px solid #5a8b47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#5a8b47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">再补一点：本篇最容易失分处在 <b>气压带风带随太阳直射点南北移动</b>——记得画简图辅助分析！</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🎯 六、印证·真题范式</h3><p>本章高考真题围绕 <b>大气受热三过程：太阳短波→地面吸收→地面长波→大气增温</b> 与 <b>热力环流：冷高压/热低压</b> 展开。<br>解题：读材料→定位→分析→结论。</p><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🧘 七、参悟·记忆口诀</h3><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f8ee,#e6f0dd);border:1px dashed #5a8b47;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#3a5a2e\"><b>📜 大气与气候要吃透，大气受热三过程：太阳短波→地面是根本；因果链要理清楚，图文结合最稳妥。</b></div><div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5a8b4722,#5a8b4711);border-left:4px solid #5a8b47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#5a8b47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">徒儿，地理不是死记地图——是理解地表的\"人地关系\"！</span></div>",
