    "content": "<div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5a8b4722,#5a8b4711);border-left:4px solid #5a8b47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#5a8b47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">徒儿，今日为师传你 <b>《永续护脉道》</b>，属于<b>选必3·第二章</b>，磐山界之核心。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🌍 一、引道·地理精髓</h3><p>全球变暖、臭氧层、酸雨、生物多样性；可持续发展三原则。</p><div class=\"dlg-shimei\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4a3c822,#f4a3c811);border-left:4px solid #f4a3c8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#f4a3c8\">🎀 师妹：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">师姐，地理综合题好难！</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shijie\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c67ecb22,#c67ecb11);border-left:4px solid #c67ecb;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#c67ecb\">🌸 师姐：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">地理讲究\"地对人\"——先看<b>全球变暖：CO₂ 增加→温室效应</b>，再分析人类活动如何回应。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">📖 二、拆经·五大要点</h3><ul style=\"padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9\"><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 全球变暖：CO₂ 增加→温室效应</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 酸雨：SO₂/NOx 排放→pH<5.6</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 臭氧层：氟氯烃破坏</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 可持续发展三原则：公平性、持续性、共同性</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 循环经济：减量化、再利用、再循环</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🗺️ 三、图解·关键公式/数据</h3><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f8ee,#e6f0dd);border:1px dashed #5a8b47;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#3a5a2e\"><b>📜 酸雨 pH<5.6</b></div><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f8ee,#e6f0dd);border:1px dashed #5a8b47;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#3a5a2e\"><b>📜 可持续 = 满足当代需求且不损害后代</b></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🔥 四、演道·典型案例</h3><p>我国节能减排：'双碳'目标 2030 碳达峰、2060 碳中和</p><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">💬 五、对话·师徒印证</h3><div class=\"dlg-shixiong\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4a7fc822,#4a7fc811);border-left:4px solid #4a7fc8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#4a7fc8\">⚔️ 大师兄：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">地理答题最重要的三条：<b>①区位分析要全面 ②因果链要完整 ③结合材料信息</b>。别死背模板！</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shimei\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4a3c822,#f4a3c811);border-left:4px solid #f4a3c8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#f4a3c8\">🎀 师妹：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">答案总是不够全面怎么办？</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shijie\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c67ecb22,#c67ecb11);border-left:4px solid #c67ecb;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#c67ecb\">🌸 师姐：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">用<b>自然（气候/地形/水文/土壤/植被）+ 社会经济（人/交/市/技/政）</b>的框架去扫描。</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5a8b4722,#5a8b4711);border-left:4px solid #5a8b47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#5a8b47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">再补一点：本篇最容易失分处在 <b>循环经济：减量化、再利用、再循环</b>——记得画简图辅助分析！</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🎯 六、印证·真题范式</h3><p>本章高考真题围绕 <b>全球变暖：CO₂ 增加→温室效应</b> 与 <b>酸雨：SO₂/NOx 排放→pH<5.6</b> 展开。<br>解题：读材料→定位→分析→结论。</p><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5a8b4733,transparent);border-left:5px solid #5a8b47;color:#3a5a2e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🧘 七、参悟·记忆口诀</h3><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f8ee,#e6f0dd);border:1px dashed #5a8b47;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#3a5a2e\"><b>📜 环境保护与可持续发展要吃透，全球变暖：CO₂ 增加→温室效是根本；因果链要理清楚，图文结合最稳妥。</b></div><div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5a8b4722,#5a8b4711);border-left:4px solid #5a8b47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#5a8b47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">徒儿，地理不是死记地图——是理解地表的\"人地关系\"！</span></div>",
